%F A161206 From _Benoit Cloitre_, Nov 21 2026: (Start)
%F A161206 G.f.: (1+x)*(1+2*x^2)/(1-x) * (x/(1-x) + 2*Sum_{k>=1} x^(2^(k+1))*(C_{2^k}(x)-1)*G(x^(2^(k+2)))), where G(x) = Product_{j>=0} (1+2*x^(2^j)) and C_r(x) is the cone birth polynomial defined in Section 2.2 of my arxiv paper.
%F A161206 a(n) = n^2*Psi(n/2^k)+O(n^log_2(3)*(log(n))^2), where k = floor(log_2(n)) and Psi is the continuous function on [1,2] specified in my arxiv paper (Theorem 32).
%F A161206 The constant kappa is given by the convergent series kappa = 5/6-(1/6)*Sum_{k>=1} (C_{2^k}(1)-C_{2^k-1}(1))/4^k = 0.687915685568298445... .
%F A161206 min_{u=1..2} Psi(u) = Psi(4/3) = 9*kappa/8; max_{u=1..2} Psi(u) = Psi(1) = Psi(2) = 3*kappa/2.
%F A161206 Hence liminf_{n->infinity} a(n)/n^2=9*kappa/8=0.773905146264335750...
%F A161206 and limsup_{n->infinity} a(n)/n^2=3*kappa/2=1.031873528352447667... .
%F A161206 In particular, a(2^k) ~ (3*kappa/2)*4^k as k -> infinity. (End)
